From: TaterTotterson <tater@tatertotterson.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Keep S420 hardware and firmware packaging on the shared runtime

Shared wake, boundary, playback and native protocol features are upstream.
This patch contains only S420 capture/AEC, peripheral events and packaging.

